INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have been waiting for these. It\'s about time! Now I can finally get some work done.', 0),
(40081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good work out there, $C. Keeping the road safe and thinning the pack of mongrels will only be for the greater good.', 0),
(40082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Chief Rnarl, you have eluded me for so long, but no longer. Well done, $N, you did what I could not. You are a skilled fighter and worthy of praise. When Steepcliff Port gets more established, return, and we can share a corpse.', 0),
(40083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work. We have certainly put a dent in those Rogue Wizards, but I still feel there is more to be done.', 0),
(40084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent work. We have certainly put a dent in those Rogue Wizards, but I still feel there is more to be done.', 0),
(40085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Another victory—and more books to read. Thanks again, friend. Take these coins for the hard work.', 0),
(40086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gordon must have sent you, and on time too. He has been a steady help here at Glenshire. Without him, I would be quite out of luck working.', 0),
(40087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You did it? Well, I was honestly not expecting you to return! I wish you had arrived a few days earlier, then We might have avoided this whole situation to begin with.', 0),
(40088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, I can smell the blood coming from your bag. Is that the head of the mongrel? Good, very good. With the mine and tower back in our control, we are one step closer to achieving complete rule over the Tirisfal Uplands.', 0),
(40096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well done. With those scouts gone, they will think twice before sending an attack force on Glenshire.', 0),
(40097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, yes. My greatest asset returns, successful, no less. With the sentries gone, we will have a much easier time dealing with the miserable humans.', 0),
(40098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmmm, you managed to impress my husband? Let\'s see if you will do the same for me.', 0),
(40099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have received news that the humans did their part precisely as planned. They have brought our little gift into their main camp. You did marvelously, my dear.', 0),
(40136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Look at that, a chunk of finely cut meat. Are you sure you are not some mysterious chef who is an adventurer by the day and chef by night? Anyways, thanks a lot. This will surely help. And here, I hope this is a suitable enough reward.', 0),
(40137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thanks, you might not have eradicated them completely, but this will surely make them think twice before attacking us again. Oh, and here is your reward.', 0),
(40138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You are fast. Have you ever considered changing your profession to being a bounty hunter? Anyways, here is your share, and thanks for the job well done.', 0),
(40139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Finally, some good news. As promised, here is your reward.', 0),
(40140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, the necromancer is dead, this truly is reassuring news. Without you, we might have had to retreat into the Tirisfal Glades, and even worse, the Scourge would have been able to attack the Forsaken from both the west and east. You have done us a great service. I think you should have this as a just reward for your deeds.', 0),
(40220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You carry that weapon well, but it is not enough to be an adequate marksman. The Dark Lady, Sylvanas Windrunner, freed you from the shackles that bound you to the will of the Lich King. You will return her gracious gift by giving of yourself for her cause.$B$BIf you cannot commit, I will see to it personally you are buried again in the hole you crawled out of. I will train you to be one of the many arrows that strike the hearts of her foes.$B$BCome to me often, that I may teach you new skills. I will be watching you carefully and gauging your growth here in Deathknell.', 0),
(40248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Most excellent. I can see this darkhound is eager to sink its fangs into the Scourge and gnaw on their bones.$B$BYou have performed... adequately.', 0),
(40249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This creature flies around you with a spirit of ease. It would seem that you have earned its trust.$B$BYou are improving.', 0),
(40250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This beast no longer feels lost, your strength of will earning its trust and coaxing from it once suppressed emotions. Though we dominate, we are not incapable of affection for our new companions.$B$BNever forget that each beast has its own story. Your actions will bring to them salvation... or destruction.', 0),
(40260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Morpheus sent you from Deathknell?$B$BIt\'s been a while since I have seen someone wish to walk this path. You are most welcome, that is if you can keep up with the training.', 0),
(40261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'And you are...?$B$BOh, yes. Morpheus and Lanissa spoke on your behalf. I suppose it is time, then, to offer you my expertise.', 0),
(40262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well, well, what have you brought me? My, what a gorgeous, fresh specimen! Allow me to assist you with that.$B$BI will teach you the incantation by which you can persuade creatures who still walk among the living to serve you faithfully.', 0),
(40263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have done well.$B$BIt is a tragedy what all the Scourge took from many of us beyond our sanity. That Boltrus still clung to emotions from his past life stirs something within me. I wonder... By another fate, could I have been in his place? A barely sentient yet mindless husk?$B$B... Alas.', 0),
(40277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I wish I was there to see the look on her miserable face when she realized one last time that she was never able to beat me. Neither in life nor in death, my dear sister. You have proven to be quite an ally, $C. From this day forth, consider yourself welcome to my court... when I rebuild it, of course.', 0),
(40278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'And who might you be? The Duke sent you? On with it then, I\'m a busy man.', 0),
(40279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A magical lock? Naturally. Nothing can ever just be simple.', 0),
(40280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A letter for me? That ignorant son of a... Apologies, $C. That man certainly knows how to get on my nerves. I will do this for him, but this is the last time I deal with that accursed family.', 0),
(40318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What\'s this? This letter bears the crest of Lordaeron. I must say, it has been quite some time since I received a letter marked with this sigil.', 0),
(40319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, there is no help coming? It seems we must look to ourselves to keep the last torch within these lands alight.$B$BThank you for delivering the letter. You are dismissed.', 0),
(40320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Ah, fine pieces, and they don\'t seem touched by the taint of the plague. They will do nicely, thanks again, it means a lot.', 0),
(41364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So the Shadowfang Keep will soon be raided. Good. While you\'re here, you wouldn\'t mind doing me a favor, would you?', 0),
(41365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'While the living are now seen as a threat, his death was unjustifiable. It needed to be done...$B$BI will mourn you for the rest of my days, William.', 0),
(60107, 16, 26, 0, 0, 5, 7, 0, 0, 'My slippers! Thank you very much! You have shown a great kindness to me. Please take this coin for your troubles. Dark lady watch over you.', 0),
(60113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good. Goooood. This should be plenty of blood to perfect my plague. The other apothecaries would be jealous of this advantage.', 0),
(60140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Austil takes the bandages and uses them to lash some of his looser extremities into place.>$B$BAh, thank you. This will do nicely.$B$BI\'m sorry if I snapped at you before. Having bits of oneself threatening to escape at any moment does tend to make one a little grumpy.$B$BBut I feel much better now. Maybe I\'ll go even talk to old Farthing.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40080, 0, 0, 'Hello, can I help you?', 0),
(40081, 0, 0, 'These mongrels are nothing more than a stepping stone for the Forsaken. Deal with them.', 0),
(40082, 0, 0, 'Have you slain the mongrels, or are you simply waiting for them to leave?', 0),
(40083, 0, 0, 'We must act quickly, lest they begin to harness their magical power.', 0),
(40084, 0, 0, 'Have you dealt with the wizards, $N?', 0),
(40085, 0, 0, 'Have you found their tomes, books and trinkets, $N?', 0),
(40086, 0, 0, 'Hello, can I help you?', 0),
(40087, 0, 0, 'Back so soon, $C?', 0),
(40088, 0, 0, 'How goes the attack?', 0),
(40096, 0, 0, 'Is it done?', 0),
(40097, 0, 0, 'Tell me, how goes the attack?', 0),
(40098, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40099, 0, 0, 'Back already?', 0),
(40136, 0, 0, 'Back already?', 0),
(40137, 0, 0, 'Any luck?', 0),
(40138, 0, 0, 'How goes the hunt?', 0),
(40139, 0, 0, 'Were you successful?', 0),
(40140, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40220, 0, 0, 'You must know why I sent for you, $N. Seeing a fallen marksman rise again is such a rare glimmer of hope in this accursed land. Lady Sylvanas will no doubt be pleased that she may one day soon have ranks of ranger under her command again.$B$BI will see to it that you are molded into a proper vessel for fulfilling that dream. Embrace now your destiny as a Dark Ranger.', 0),
(40248, 1, 0, 'Do not waste my time. The Dark Lady has no need of the weak, nor do I for that matter.', 0),
(40249, 1, 0, 'Being undead does not make you a cripple. My expectations of you are no lower than if you were still alive.', 0),
(40250, 1, 0, 'Time and dedication this path takes. As your luck would have it, I have begun to see you possess both.', 0),
(40260, 0, 0, 'Be quick about your business, I don\'t have the leisure to be here all day.', 0),
(40263, 0, 0, 'How goes your task?', 0),
(40277, 0, 0, 'Is it done?', 0),
(40278, 0, 0, 'I\'m busy.', 0),
(40279, 0, 0, 'What did he say?', 0),
(40280, 0, 0, 'And who might you be?', 0),
(40318, 0, 0, 'How can I help you?', 0),
(40319, 0, 0, 'Any good news?', 0),
(40320, 0, 0, 'Have you gotten them yet?', 0),
(41364, 0, 0, 'We do our mistress\' bidding.', 0),
(41365, 0, 0, 'Speak your piece.', 0),
(60107, 0, 0, 'Hello again, $N. Have you made the trip to the shore North of Solliden Farmstead yet?', 0),
(60113, 0, 0, 'It shouldn\'t be hard to find the Solliden Farmstead. That\'s where you got the pumpkins from... if you can\'t remember that, then I suggest getting a brain replacement.', 0),
(60140, 0, 0, 'Every minute that passes is another minute for pieces to fall off of me, $N!', 0);
